---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Blog - Spreadsheet Health Checker">
  <main class="main">
    <header class="blog-header">
      <div class="blog-header-content">
        <h1>Spreadsheet Health Checker Blog</h1>
        <p>Tips, guides, and best practices for spreadsheet validation, data quality, and error prevention.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="blog-grid">
      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <div class="blog-meta">
            <time>Sep 20, 2026</time>
            <span class="tags">Excel · Formula Errors · Validation</span>
          </div>
          <h2><a href="/blog/excel-formula-errors">How to Find and Fix Excel Formula Errors Automatically</a></h2>
          <p>Learn how to automatically detect #REF!, #DIV/0!, #VALUE!, circular references, and other common spreadsheet formula errors using automated tools.</p>
          <a href="/blog/excel-formula-errors" class="read-more">Read more →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <div class="blog-meta">
            <time>Sep 18, 2026</time>
            <span class="tags">Data Quality · Validation · Cleaning</span>
          </div>
          <h2><a href="/blog/data-quality-checks">Data Quality Checks Every Spreadsheet Needs</a></h2>
          <p>Essential data quality validation techniques: mixed types, numbers stored as text, duplicate keys, whitespace anomalies, and blank clusters.</p>
          <a href="/blog/data-quality-checks" class="read-more">Read more →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <div class="blog-meta">
            <time>Sep 15, 2026</time>
            <span class="tags">Excel Diff · Version Comparison · Audit</span>
          </div>
          <h2><a href="/blog/comparing-spreadsheet-versions">How to Compare Two Excel Files and Spot Every Difference</a></h2>
          <p>Step-by-step guide to comparing spreadsheet versions: cell-by-cell diff, formula changes, value changes, and automated comparison tools.</p>
          <a href="/blog/comparing-spreadsheet-versions" class="read-more">Read more →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <footer class="blog-footer">
      <p>Want to validate your spreadsheets? <a href="/dashboard">Try Spreadsheet Health Checker free</a>.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <style>
    .main { min-height: 100vh; }
    
    .blog-header {
      background: #f9fafb;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    
    .blog-header-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .blog-header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #1f2937; }
    .blog-header p { font-size: 1.125rem; color: #6b7280; margin: 0; }
    
    .blog-grid {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 3rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .blog-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    
    .blog-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    
    .blog-card-content { padding: 1.5rem; }
    
    .blog-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    
    .blog-meta time { font-weight: 500; color: #6b7280; }
    .tags { color: #667eea; }
    
    .blog-card h2 { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.375rem; line-height: 1.3; }
    .blog-card h2 a { color: #1f2937; text-decoration: none; }
    .blog-card h2 a:hover { color: #667eea; }
    
    .blog-card p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; }
    
    .read-more {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #667eea;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .read-more:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    
    .blog-footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .blog-footer a { color: #667eea; font-weight: 500; }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .blog-header { padding: 2rem 1rem; }
      .blog-header h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; }
      .blog-grid { gap: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>